---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';

const updated = '2026-05-19';
---

<Layout
  title="Ahora — Christian Elías Cruz González"
  description="What I'm working on, learning, and exploring right now. / Qué estoy haciendo, aprendiendo y explorando en este momento."
>
  <Nav />
  <main id="main-content" class="now-main">
    <div class="container">

      <header class="now-header reveal">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">
          <span class="lang-es">En este momento</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Right now</span>
        </p>
        <h1 class="now-title">
          <span class="lang-es">Ahora</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Now</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="now-updated">
          <span class="lang-es">Última actualización: {updated}</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Last updated: {updated}</span>
        </p>
        <p class="now-intro">
          <span class="lang-es">
            Una página <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/now</a> es un snapshot de lo que estoy haciendo en este momento de mi vida.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-en">
            A <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/now</a> page is a snapshot of what I'm focused on at this point in my life.
          </span>
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="now-body">

        <div class="now-section reveal" style="--delay: 0.1s">
          <h2>
            <span class="lang-es">Trabajando en</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Working on</span>
          </h2>
          <div class="now-content">
            <p>
              <span class="lang-es">
                Construyendo interfaces de tiempo real para plataformas IoT industriales usando React y TypeScript. Me enfoco en rendimiento, visualización de datos complejos y arquitectura de componentes escalable.
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en">
                Building real-time interfaces for industrial IoT platforms with React and TypeScript. My focus is on performance, complex data visualization, and scalable component architecture.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="now-section reveal" style="--delay: 0.2s">
          <h2>
            <span class="lang-es">Explorando</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Exploring</span>
          </h2>
          <div class="now-content">
            <p>
              <span class="lang-es">
                Integrando herramientas de IA en flujos de trabajo de desarrollo frontend. Experimentando con agentes, Claude Code y APIs de AI para automatizar tareas repetitivas y mejorar la calidad del código.
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en">
                Integrating AI tooling into frontend development workflows. Experimenting with agents, Claude Code, and AI APIs to automate repetitive tasks and improve code quality.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="now-section reveal" style="--delay: 0.3s">
          <h2>
            <span class="lang-es">Aprendiendo</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Learning</span>
          </h2>
          <div class="now-content">
            <ul>
              <li>
                <span class="lang-es">Arquitectura de software: patrones, principios de diseño y cómo tomar mejores decisiones estructurales en proyectos grandes</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Software architecture: patterns, design principles, and making better structural decisions in large projects</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="lang-es">Arquitecturas de agentes de IA y su integración con aplicaciones web</span>
                <span class="lang-en">AI agent architectures and their integration with web applications</span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="lang-es">Nuevas características de CSS: container queries, @layer, anchor positioning</span>
                <span class="lang-en">New CSS features: container queries, @layer, anchor positioning</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="now-section reveal" style="--delay: 0.4s">
          <h2>
            <span class="lang-es">Escribiendo</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Writing</span>
          </h2>
          <div class="now-content">
            <p>
              <span class="lang-es">
                Documentando reflexiones sobre el oficio del frontend, herramientas de IA y lo que aprendo día a día en el blog.
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en">
                Documenting thoughts on the frontend craft, AI tooling, and daily learnings on the blog.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .now-main {
    padding-top: 64px;
    min-height: 100svh;
  }

  .now-header {
    padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .now-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .now-updated {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .now-intro {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .now-intro a {
    color: var(--accent-light);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(130, 170, 255, 0.3);
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }
  .now-intro a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .now-body {
    max-width: 680px;
    padding: 3rem 0 6rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .now-section {
    padding: 2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition-delay: var(--delay, 0s);
  }

  .now-section:first-child {
    border-top: none;
  }

  .now-section h2 {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-2);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .now-content p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .now-content ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .now-content ul li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .now-content ul li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
